    <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-77" contextRef="c-51">&lt;p&gt;Citizens Sycamore-Penasquitos Transmission LLC (the &amp;quot;Company&amp;quot;) is a limited liability company, organized under the laws of the Delaware Limited Liability Company Act. The Company is a 100% subsidiary of Citizens Enterprises Corporation. Thus, Citizens Enterprises Corporation indirectly manages and controls the Company.&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
